      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Declared-Value Transit Marine Insurance Tariffs &amp; GST Compliance for packers and movers charges from delhi to hyderabad</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When hiring a professional packer‑and‑mover to transport goods from Delhi to Hyderabad, the service provider must comply with a set of statutory tax and insurance obligations that protect both the customer and the carrier.</p>

<p>GST is the primary tax levied on the freight and handling charges. Depending on the nature of the cargo and the value declared, the service can be taxed at either the standard rate of 18% or, where applicable, a reduced rate of 5% under the “Goods and Services Tax (GST) on Transport of Goods” provisions.</p>
<p>The 5% slab applies to certain categories of goods such as perishable items, hazardous materials, or if the carrier qualifies under the “Special GST Rate for Transport of Goods” scheme. The carrier must file the relevant GST returns (GSTR‑1 and GSTR‑3B) and issue a tax invoice that clearly states the rate applied.</p>

<p>In addition to GST, most reputable firms add a transit marine insurance component to their tariff. This insurance covers loss or damage that may occur during the journey. The premium is typically calculated as a percentage of the declared value of the goods:</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 01</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">1.5% of the declared value for standard cargo</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
