    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">3% for fragile or highly perishable goods that require special handling</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Customers should verify that the insurance is “transit marine” and that it covers the entire route from Delhi to Hyderabad, including loading, unloading, and any intermediate storage. The carrier’s policy should also provide a claims procedure that includes:</p>

<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Immediate notification within 24 hours of any incident</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Submission of a claim form with photographic evidence and a copy of the transport manifest</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Assessment by an independent adjuster and settlement within 30 days of claim approval</span></li>
</ul>

<p>By understanding these statutory structures and insurance details, clients can make informed decisions, ensure compliance, and safeguard their goods throughout the move.</p></div>
